sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor V as Visitor
    participant W as Assistant widget
    participant E as TYPO3 eID<br/>agui_assistant
    participant A as Agent (nr-llm)
    V->>W: asks a question
    W->>E: POST RunAgentInput (SSE)
    E-->>W: RUN_STARTED
    E->>A: stream answer
    A-->>W: TEXT_MESSAGE_CONTENT (chunks)
    E-->>W: TOOL_CALL confirm_booking
    Note over V,W: human-in-the-loop gate
    V->>W: approves
    W->>E: approval + lead
    E-->>W: STATE_DELTA + RUN_FINISHED
